2. bin/biscuit-tool: this project's code, with zlib, musl and libgcc
---------------------------------------------------------------------

biscuit-tool is built from zip/biscuit-tool.c (MIT, this project) by
tools/build-biscuit-tool.sh, with Alpine edge armv7's gcc 15.2.0-r9,
binutils 2.45.1-r1, musl-dev 1.2.6-r3 and zlib-static 1.3.2-r0. It statically
links zlib 1.3.2 (section 4), musl libc (section 3) and libgcc (section 5).


